<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Talbots cut to long-term neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Talbots cut to long-term neutral.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch &amp; Co said it cut Talbots Inc to a long-term neutral from buy on Wednesday. It kept the stock as in intermediate-term neutral.</p>
<p>-- The company said late Tuesday that its June same-store sales fell 7.9 percent.</p>
<p>-- After the opening of trading, shares were delayed due to an imbalance.  They were indicated at $24 to $27, down from their Tuesday close of $29 on the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
</text>
